msgctxt "40228"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40764"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41784"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42076"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42544"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43456"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47684"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47728"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520588"
msgid "It's a sight I'm well acquainted with at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521088"
msgid "\"Morning, #C236196003Saber#CDEF. I'm glad I got to see you again.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521164"
msgid "Ahh―――I haven't heard your nice voice\nin a while. Hearing it is reward enough\nfor my toils."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521696"
msgid "You truly have luck on your side.\nSee, within this new #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF,\nI'm now a top Servant in high demand!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522388"
msgid "Mhm! That's my Praetor!\nThen take my hand and let's go!\nThis is no time for dawdling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522488"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF offers her hand, eager to dash off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522564"
msgid "…fine with me, but what for?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522864"
msgid "R-right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523416"
msgid "Promise…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "523808"
msgid "Our long-awaited victory is nigh!\nOpen,\nNuptiae Domus Aurea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524040"
msgid "Pay no mind that this isn't traditional to Rome.\nThe only resource I had available\nnearby was the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF's church."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524492"
msgid "She remembered, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524784"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF dashes off.\nShe pulls me by the hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524852"
msgid "We run to the church practically in skip, in a frolic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "524912"
msgid "#C080080080…this is the final record contained within the old #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF#C080080080.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "525216"
msgid "#C080080080The legend of the Moon may have ended,\nbut their legend continues.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

